{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_020meg0674_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_020meg0674_1004_020meg", "source_sha256": "8cf0be42cd9529920c5862724f2267b856f4c12d78093988732b559cc00d5e65", "ja": "あれ？　でもエドガー的には、\n好きじゃダメなのかな？", "zh": "咦？不过站在埃德加的角度来看，\n光是喜欢还不行吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_020meg0674_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_020meg0674_1005_p", "source_sha256": "002cf1452f69392492428c13e7e5b93b850a19d3873e3a3900795864051b438f", "ja": "？　どうして？", "zh": "为什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_020meg0674_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_020meg0674_1006_020meg", "source_sha256": "34e6a5cd45ed70ae377d6cabf1239d1f04622a859d4b4e774cb4e1ca60c9ff3e", "ja": "だってほら、エドガーは男の子の格好してるけど、\nホントは女の子でしょ？", "zh": "因为你看，埃德加虽然打扮成男孩子，\n但其实是女孩子吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_020meg0674_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_020meg0674_1007_020meg", "source_sha256": "943478acc20602d9c08149a019351a94bb87e006eeb1de199c1dfe50609ac451", "ja": "男の子のフリをしてるのは、身の安全のためだし。\n本当は、女の子の格好がしたかったのかな……。", "zh": "假装成男孩子，是为了自身安全。其实，她可能是想穿女孩子的衣服吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_020meg0674_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_020meg0674_1008_p", "source_sha256": "f98e3dcad41b1a7225aca40bd3f514d6cecb9a98079d8841d9fcb3bd40422bc4", "ja": "ああ、それはあるかもしれないな。", "zh": "啊，确实有这种可能。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_020meg0674_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_020meg0674_1009_020meg", "source_sha256": "a8d425ee76fd8ffbe9367773fd7dfbdb2c640a6779f474c660fb27cc701208b6", "ja": "でも、エドガーはこれから旅に出るんだよね？\nクリスと一緒に。", "zh": "不过，埃德加接下来要踏上旅途了吧？\n和克里斯一起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_020meg0674_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_020meg0674_1010_020meg", "source_sha256": "5969137fd8de40bdb5a47c7aeb3571c57e3e166af78ef4b2cae7c16bfc85014a", "ja": "クリス可愛いからな～。\nエドガーまで女の子になっちゃうと、心配だな～！", "zh": "因为克里斯很可爱嘛～。\n要是连埃德加都变成女孩子了，可就让人担心了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_020meg0674_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_020meg0674_1011_p", "source_sha256": "3cdbbdc472b25bb4a5b9d939734a7b5caaef4f1f2d4883087ba1609b0c9b9cd2", "ja": "確かに……。クリスには明かしたとはいえ、すぐ\n女の子の格好をする訳にはいかないのかもしれないな。", "zh": "确实……。虽然已经向克里斯坦白了，但也不能马上就扮成女孩子的样子吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_020meg0674_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_020meg0674_1012_p", "source_sha256": "fda5c760c7f2560c8a9d973c5925f95f37a40529ec85656a4d3166fdc9fa226b", "ja": "それに、恵美は気に入ったんだろ？", "zh": "而且，惠美也喜欢上了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_020meg0674_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_020meg0674_1013_020meg", "source_sha256": "84ed848678848f43a9364100ebcc68e479ac763365f7f7f5a24f09feca32c34d", "ja": "うん！　エドガーにしてみたら、いろいろ\n複雑な気持ちがあるかもしれないけど……。", "zh": "嗯！对埃德加来说，可能心情会有些复杂……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_020meg0674_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_020meg0674_1014_020meg", "source_sha256": "03a1b9e5fc7fe7517bb4f3f22e9043f5471472fbfa87b63c3e0673ef91c133a8", "ja": "それでも、エドガーを守ってくれた服ではあるし。\nデザインもいい感じだし、アタシは好き！", "zh": "即便如此，它也是保护过埃德加的衣服嘛。  \n设计也很不错，我喜欢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
