{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_020meg0674_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_020meg0674_1023_020meg", "source_sha256": "3038516b94b693981fa142d38b4b0934b4634029e36d4304852abde2f7ac94da", "ja": "そうだよね。これからこの衣装で、\nい～っぱい、色んな景色を見ていくんだもんね！", "zh": "对吧。接下来就要穿着这套服装，去看好多好多不同的景色了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
